      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "A High Scepter shall only serve one Master.\r\nAnd my master is Queen Cress, not Prince Nedo.",
        "Jp" : "ハイセプターはただ一人の王を戴く\r\n私の王はクレス様であって――\r\nネド王子ではないんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 735914,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If Prince Nedo were to choose someone to train\r\nthe next High Scepter, 'twould\r\nundoubtedly be yours truly.\r\nYet, I wonder how the Prince truly perceives the\r\nrole of the High Scepter.",
        "Jp" : "ネド王子がハイセプターにと選んだ者に\r\n稽古を付けるなら私だけど――\r\nはたして、王子はハイセプターという職を\r\nどう思っているのかな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 765741,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 28645,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, it's a humble home, but please make\r\nyourself comfortable.\r\nActually, I was born a mere noble before\r\nbecoming a High Scepter.\r\nI've always longed for this carefree lifestyle.",
        "Jp" : "まぁ、あばら家だがゆっくりしていってくれ\r\n実は、ハイセプターとなる前から\r\n地方貴族の端くれの生まれでね\r\nこういう気ままな生活に憧れていたのさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 735913,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 28646,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "While the High Scepter wields a sword, it is not\r\na job that relies only on slash strikes.",
        "Jp" : "ハイセプターは剣を持つが\r\n剣そのものの斬撃に頼るジョブではないよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 735912,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Employing a sword to strike an enemy marked with\r\na magick seal serves to create an opening,\r\nallowing the attacker to exploit the enemy's\r\nvulnerability and to extract magick efficiently.",
        "Jp" : "魔印を施した敵を剣で攻撃することで\r\n敵に隙を作る――つまり、魔力を効率的に\r\n得るための道具にすぎない"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 765739,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Or, you could imbue your sword with essence and\r\ncreate a magick blade.",
        "Jp" : "あるいは、魔力を剣に纏わせて\r\n魔法でできた刃を作るとかね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 765740,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 28647,
    "GroupType" : 43,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_REGISTERD_ENTRY_TALK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "My apologies for the rudeness.\r\nIt seems I haven't introduced myself yet.\r\nI am Kirsty, the High Scepter sworn to\r\nthe late Queen Cress.",
        "Jp" : "これは失礼――自己紹介がまだだったようだ\r\n私はキルスティ、先代王クレス様のハイセプターだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 735916,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Even if I proclaim that I am the \"High Scepter,\"\r\nyou, a stranger from a foreign land, would not\r\ncomprehend its true meaning.",
        "Jp" : "《ハイセプター》といってみせても\r\n異国から来た君にはわからないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764215,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, the High Scepter is a unique existence.\r\nThey serve their master, support them, offer\r\nadvice, and protect them.",
        "Jp" : "そうだな――ハイセプターとは\r\n王に仕え、王を支え、助言し、護る\r\nそんな唯一の存在だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764216,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Standing apart from the numerous lords, the High\r\nScepter enjoys the unique privilege of\r\ndirectly advising the King.",
        "Jp" : "数多の諸侯とは一線を画し\r\n時には王に直接意見することも許されている"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764217,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And what defines their special position?\r\nThe \"mystic arts\" wielded by the High Scepter.\r\nA combat technique that seizes the life force of\r\nthe enemy as their own.",
        "Jp" : "そして、そんな特別な立場を\r\n確固たるものとしているのが\r\nハイセプターの操る\"秘術\"\r\n敵の生命力を我が物とする戦闘術さ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764218,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Seems like you're interested.\r\nUnfortunately, the secret techniques of the High\r\nScepter are only passed down in a lineage of one\r\nmaster to one apprentice.",
        "Jp" : "――なにやら興味がありそうな素振りだね\r\n残念ながら、ハイセプターの秘術は\r\n一子相伝ってやつなのさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764219,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's not like I'm passing it down to my own\r\nchild, but— you're not the kind of person who, no\r\nmatter how you turn out, is going to serve House\r\nAcre from now on, won't you?\r\nYou're not even fit to be a good apprentice.",
        "Jp" : "何も実の子供に伝えるわけじゃないけど――\r\n君はどう転んだって、今後アッカー家のためだけに\r\n尽くしていくような人間じゃないだろう？\r\n弟子として取るにも不合格だね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764220,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 28648,
    "GroupType" : 44,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_JM_TUTO_ORDER",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—Huh?\r\nThat's strange, indeed.\r\nSeems like you're taking strides towards\r\nbecoming a High Scepter.",
        "Jp" : "――――あれ？\r\nおかしなことがあるものだな\r\n君はどうやらハイセプターとしての\r\n一歩を踏み出しているようだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 786837,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Putting technique aside, You understand the\r\nbasics: to \"mark\" the enemy, draw out their\r\nmagick and make it your own.",
        "Jp" : "技巧は置いておいて\r\n敵を\"引っ掻いて\"魔力を引きずり出し\r\n己の力とする――という基礎はわかってるんだね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764081,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now then, as the current High Scepter, I hold no\r\nrecollection of imparting any teachings to you.\r\nSo I wonder if a High Scepter from the very\r\nfuture or past has taken a liking to you?",
        "Jp" : "さて――当代のハイセプターたる私は\r\n君に教えを授けた覚えはない――\r\nとなれば、未来もしくは過去のハイセプターが\r\n君のことを気に入ったのかな？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764082,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, I don't know what will happen with the\r\nrelationship between the Acre Royal Family and\r\nthe High Scepter in the future.\r\nPrince Nedo may not even need the High Scepter.",
        "Jp" : "まぁ、アッカー王家とハイセプターの関係も\r\n今後どうなるのかはわからない――\r\nネド王子はハイセプターの助けを\r\n必要としないかもしれないからね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764083,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you'd like, shall I observe your training?",
        "Jp" : "よかったら、君の修練を見てあげようか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764084,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "While I have no intention of appointing you\r\nas the future High Scepter, \r\nI suppose there could be an exception or two\r\nthroughout history.\r\nAfter all, should the unthinkable happen\r\nand you become the last High Scepter...\r\nWell, that'd be quite a tale to tell.\r\nHahaha...",
        "Jp" : "君を未来のハイセプターと任ずるつもりはないが\r\nまぁ、歴史上一人くらいは例外がいてもよかろうよ\r\n万が一の時は、君がこの世で最後のハイセプターだ\r\nハハハ――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764085,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 28649,
    "GroupType" : 46,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_APPRAISE_INTRO",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I commend your enthusiasm, but I fear you're\r\ngetting ahead of yourself.\r\nWithout a solid foundation in the fundamentals,\r\nyou'll face insurmountable obstacles in your path.",
        "Jp" : "君の気概は認めるが\r\nどうにも気持ちが先走ってるみたいだね？\r\nある程度は基礎をものにしないと\r\nこの先どうにもならないよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 735918,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 21,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As a guideline, hmm, it would be good to come\r\nback around level 18.\r\nUntil then, it's just all about practicing well.",
        "Jp" : "目安としては――\r\nそうだな、ＬＶ．18になった頃に\r\nまた来るといい\r\nそれまではひたすら練習あるのみだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 764221,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 28650,
    "GroupType" : 62,
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well now, looks like you've been working harder\r\nthan I had expected.\r\nI'll have to respond to that too.\r\nHehe, that somehow makes me happy.",
        "Jp" : "おっと、予想以上に頑張ってきたみたいだな\r\nこれには私も応えなければね\r\nふふ、なんだか嬉しいよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 735919,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
